        "source_sha256": "eab7b73a34f157a83dee576e518212f6a4607100775165c64d26810c4ef26979",
        "text": "- Home\n- Meet David\n- Issues\n- Photos\n- News\n- Endorsements\nSupport Our Campaign\nMake a Contribution Today\nClick Here to Contribute\nJoin the Campaign\nBecome a Volunteer\nClick Here to Sign Up\nShow Your Support!\nRequest a Yard Sign\nClick Here to Request a Sign\nNeed Voting Information?\nRegister & Find Your Polling Location\nClick Here for Information\n# Dave Johnson: Built in the Bay Area. Fighting for the Bay Area.\n# David Johnson is a proven fighter against the one-party rule that currently runs politics in California. He brings a common sense approach to issues that affect everyone living on the Peninsula and the South Bay. If you are tired of \"politics as usual\", please consider helping to support this campaign.\nMeet Dave Johnson – The Fighter Silicon Valley Needs\nDave Johnson is a proud, lifelong native of Santa Clara County who has built his life and career right here in the South Bay.\nFor 40 years, he’s been a hands-on leader in the commercial construction industry — from marketing and estimating to project management on major design-build projects for high-tech companies. As a small business owner (running two successful firms since 1994 and 2010), Dave knows firsthand the crushing burden of Sacramento’s endless taxes, skyrocketing regulations, and anti-business policies that are driving up costs and chasing jobs away.\nBut Dave isn’t just a builder — he’s a bold voice for common sense. He’s an active writer whose sharp articles cut through the mainstream media spin, making readers question the narratives they’re being fed.\nNow serving as Chairman of the Santa Clara County Republican Party, Dave has been a committed conservative his entire adult life. He’s stepping up to run for State Assembly because he’s fed up with the status quo — and he’s ready to fight.\nIn Sacramento, Dave will battle to stop the endless tax-and-spend cycle, slash job-killing regulations, and champion Parents’ Rights and School Choice so families — not bureaucrats — control education.\nNo fluff. No ghost campaign. Just a proven local leader with real-world experience who shows up, speaks out, and gets results.\n# California is Broken. Dave will Fix it.\nMake a Donation\nOur campaign is powered by your donations.\n$10 $25 $50 $100 $250 $500 $1000 Other\nSign Up for Updates\nFirst name Last name Email Zip/Postal Message\nThanks for signing up!\n- Voter Information\n- Endorsements\n- Events\n- Photos\n- Contact\n- Privacy Policy\nCommittee to Elect David Johnson\nPowered by CampaignPartner.com\n- Home\n- Meet David\n- Issues\n- Endorsements\n- Photos\n- Privacy Policy\n- Contribute\n- Volunteer\n- News\n- Events\n- Contact\n- Voter Information\nClose Menu",
        "text_limited": false,
        "title": "David Johnson for Assembly District 23",
